          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: The witness took several photos on June 7, 2009 at 1:39 PM on the plateau de Caussol. It was later that he noticed, in the lower left corner of one photograph, a ring-shaped, silver-colored object. The suspected object, located in the top left of the photo, was not seen by the witness. The blurry shape clearly resembles a flying insect (body and wings visible), probably very close to the lens. The landscape and season are conducive to insects. The GEIPAN classifies this case as \"B\": probable photograph of a small flying insect.",
